#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Render a presentation outline YAML into one self-contained HTML deck, in the reference style of the decks.

One slide at a time, phone first and dark first, bilingual (English and Portuguese, PT|EN): big titles with one
amber word, spaced uppercase labels, plain lists revealed in turn with the previous item dimmed, the source at
the bottom, terminals that type each command, wait for ⏎ and print the output line by line, a bar (home,
previous, A−, A+, notes, References, next) and a navigation pad, notes in a panel and QR codes in an overlay,
the references in a deck of their own. The rules live in docs/agent/decks.md.
"""
